    // Homemade Breathing
    "card.breathing_desc": "A breathing guide for calmer days. Follow a wave as it rises and falls while a girl breathes along with you — six techniques, from everyday coherent breathing to 4-7-8 for sleep, each at three levels, with soft sounds, a voice and haptics. No ads, no account, nothing leaves the device.",
    "breathing.meta_title": "Homemade Breathing — Slow breathing, one wave at a time",
    "breathing.meta_desc": "Homemade Breathing is a guided breathing app for iPhone and iPad: six techniques at three levels, a wave to follow, sounds, voice and haptics. No ads, no accounts, no data collection.",
    "breathing.tagline": "Slow breathing, one wave at a time.",
