    "brsup.q5": "What is Extra Focus?",
    "brsup.a5": "A small ball you steer along the wave with the up and down buttons at the bottom right. Keeping it inside the moving circle gives your hands and eyes something gentle to do, which helps your attention stay on the breath. Switch it off in Options for a hands-free session.",
    "brsup.q6": "How do the daily reminders work?",
