    'home.meta_title': 'Homemade Apps — Simple, honest apps for families',
    'home.meta_desc': 'A mother making simple, fun and educational apps for families. No ads, no subscriptions, no accounts, no data collection. Just one-time purchase apps that do one thing well.',
